TASK B40
	TITLE "Evaluate rtk as a candidate filter of shell output"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M6
	COMPONENT "runs"
	ROLE dora
	ROLE prudence
	SPEC "rtk (github.com/rtk-ai/rtk) is installed for implementation runs only, telemetry"
		+ "disabled, its hook proven to coexist with the hooks of the instructions corpus and never"
		+ "to rewrite an awawa command"
	SPEC "implementation runs read compact output: failures only, the test runner in fail-fast mode"
		+ "(bun test --bail, pytest -x)"
	SPEC "verification runs read full raw output: the verifier's pass, the merge gate of the tick"
		+ "and the evidence quoted in a report run without rtk or through rtk run"
	SPEC "a run that needs the full output of a filtered command recovers it with rtk recall"
		+ "instead of re-running it"
	SPEC "the ledger compares one wave with rtk and one without: agent steps, re-reads of oversized"
		+ "output, findings missed by the verifier"
	SPEC "a DECISION records the adoption or the rejection, with the measured comparison"
	AFTER @TASK.B21
